{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05594","headline":"璧池望秋月 · 张子容","name":"璧池望秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉夜窥清沼，池空水月秋。\n满轮沈玉镜，半魄落银钩。\n蟾影摇轻浪，菱花渡浅流。\n漏移光渐洁，云敛色偏浮。\n似璧悲三献，疑珠怯再投。\n能持千里意，来照楚乡愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}